DISCLAIMER:

This application is designed for educational purposes to help UPSC aspirants 
prepare for the Civil Services Examination. 

Web Scraping Notice:
- This software includes web scraping capabilities to gather publicly available
  information from various sources.
- Users are solely responsible for ensuring their use of the scraping features
  complies with applicable laws, website terms of service, and robots.txt files.
- The developers of this software do not endorse or encourage any violation of
  terms of service or copyright laws.
- Users should implement appropriate rate limiting and respect website policies.

AI Processing Notice:
- This software uses local AI models (via Ollama) for content processing.
- AI-generated content should be verified for accuracy.
- The quality of AI outputs depends on the model being used.

Data Privacy Notice:
- This application stores all data locally on the user's machine.
- No data is transmitted to external servers except when explicitly fetching
  news content from public sources.
- Users are responsible for backing up their own data.
